	(text_box "Designed for the Nanotec DF45 65W/50W Motors (no encoder).\n\nThe Factory provided connector (STOCKO MKF 13270-6-0-1010) is not available on DigiKey.\nThis connector must be desoldered and replaced with custom connectors. Use 26 AWG or 24 AWG wire if possible.\n28 AWG wire is okay if the connection is short\n\nJST ASACHSACH28W203 (DigiKey 455-3345-ND) pre-crimped wire has been tested to work."
